<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_72436ee376a65a4b00b92cf367104bc08a3f4c3229c4184d6cdbbd4a1bf2cdef_n0004/na_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
